flowchart LR
    User[User] --> CLI[CLI foreground launcher]
    CLI --> Server

    subgraph AppHost[Application host]
        Browser[React SPA]
        Server[Node and Hono server]
        Contract[Zod contract]
        Context[AppContext]
        Memory[activeTurns and approvals]
        Governor[Typed process local Resource Governor]
        Runtime[Sampled runtime reconciliation]
        Recovery[Pre-listen Chat recovery]
        DB[(SQLite)]
        Files[Workspace filesystem]
        Shell[Local shell]

        Browser <-->|REST and POST or GET SSE| Server
        Browser -. validates .-> Contract
        Server -. validates .-> Contract
        Server --> Context
        Context --> Memory
        Context --> Governor
        Context --> Runtime
        Context --> DB
        Context --> Recovery
        Recovery --> DB
        Recovery --> Governor
        Server --> Governor
        Server --> Runtime
        Runtime --> Governor
        Runtime --> Ollama
        Governor --> Ollama
        Server --> Files
        Server --> Shell
    end

    Server <-->|HTTP and NDJSON| Ollama[Ollama runtime]
    Server --> Catalog[Remote local or bundled catalog data]
